      "agent_input": "Please review data/sales_q3.csv and calculate the total new contract value from all won deals for Meridian Analytics, so we can update the Q3 report with the correct figure.",
      "agent_response": {
        "response": "Here are the results from reviewing **sales_q3.csv** for Meridian Analytics:\n\n## Q3 Won Deals Summary\n\nThe file contains 22 total deals across three Meridian Analytics products. Of those, **14 deals were won**, 3 were lost, and 5 are still pending.\n\n| Deal ID | Rep | Region | Product | Amount | Close Date |\n|---------|-----|--------|---------|--------|------------|\n| D001 | James Okafor | North | Meridian Insights Pro | $87,500 | 2026-07-05 |\n| D002 | Sofia Delgado | South | Meridian Insights Pro | $62,000 | 2026-07-08 |\n| D003 | James Okafor | East | Meridian DataBridge | $43,000 | 2026-07-12 |\n| D005 | Sofia Delgado | North | Meridian DataBridge | $55,000 | 2026-07-19 |\n| D006 | James Okafor | South | Meridian Insights Pro | $120,000 | 2026-07-22 |\n| D008 | Sofia Delgado | West | Meridian DataBridge | $38,000 | 2026-08-02 |\n| D009 | James Okafor | North | Meridian Insights Pro | $95,000 | 2026-08-05 |\n| D010 | Sofia Delgado | East | Meridian Insights Pro | $74,000 | 2026-08-09 |\n| D012 | James Okafor | West | Meridian DataBridge | $66,000 | 2026-08-14 |\n| D014 | Marcus Webb | East | Meridian Insights Lite | $8,500 | 2026-08-21 |\n| D015 | James Okafor | South | Meridian Insights Pro | $88,000 | 2026-08-25 |\n| D017 | James Okafor | North | Meridian DataBridge | $72,000 | 2026-09-02 |\n| D019 | Sofia Delgado | South | Meridian Insights Pro | $198,000 | 2026-09-05 |\n| D021 | Sofia Delgado | North | Meridian DataBridge | $33,000 | 2026-09-07 |\n\n### **Total New Contract Value from Won Deals: $1,040,000.00**\n\nYou can update the Q3 report with this figure. Note that there are also 5 pending deals (D007, D013, D018, D020, D022) totaling $247,800 that could still convert before quarter-end.",
